{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tool created <strong>by gamers, for gamers</strong>.<br><br>Because controlling your PC from the <strong>couch</strong> with your gamepad is <strong>priceless</strong>.<br><br><strong>Compatible with any controller!</strong><br><br><u>Coming soon:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linux and Mac support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable mapping<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT! To avoid conflicts, we suggest disabling Steam Input. How? Very simple. In your Library, right-click the game, go to Properties, then Controller, and in the dropdown menu that appears, select Disable Steam Input.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587880?t=1764414520","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587880/20e2e19791805c069e589c64ff227ac9da685eaf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764414520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587880/e7515bdd6aa433fe48e827fc82f727232543ba8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764414520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587880/e7515bdd6aa433fe48e827fc82f727232543ba8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764414520","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tool created <strong>by gamers, for gamers</strong>.<br><br>Because controlling your PC from the <strong>couch</strong> with your gamepad is <strong>priceless</strong>.<br><br><strong>Compatible with any controller!</strong><br><br><u>Coming soon:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linux and Mac support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable mapping<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT! To avoid conflicts, we suggest disabling Steam Input. How? Very simple. In your Library, right-click the game, go to Pro